# Editor backups
*~
\#*\#
.\#*
scan.pdf

# Source scans kept locally for image-verified transcription. Large, and not
# ours to redistribute (public repo + GitHub Pages). NEVER commit these.
#   scan.pdf     — KB copy, shelfmark 14,-225 8°  (the working witness)
#   bodleian.pdf — Google Books scan of the Bodleian copy (the second witness,
#                  copied from ~/bibliotek/Nielsen, Rasmus/religion-1869.pdf)
bodleian.pdf

# Page renders used for image-verified transcription
.render/

# Ebooks — privately owned copies kept alongside the texts for local
# searching only. NEVER commit/publish these (public repo + GitHub Pages).
# Note: transcription.pdf / translation.pdf are intentionally NOT ignored.
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw
*.azw3
*.kfx
*.kepub
*.fb2

# Transcription-agent scratch: page renders and crops. These are regenerable from
# the scans in bibliotek/ and must never be committed — one batch put 25 MB of PNGs
# into the history.
.scratch-*/
**/.parts/
